  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize emptying the reserve piles. Since you cannot build on them, they act as bottlenecks that hide 24 cards at the start.\n\nManage your foundations evenly. If you build one suit too far up, you might find that the corresponding descending foundation for that suit is blocked by cards you've already 'packed away'.\n\nUtilization of the 'Meeting Point': Strategic transfers between the ascending and descending foundations can be used to free up a specific card needed for the tableau.",
    Player: "Prioritize emptying the reserve piles. Since you cannot build on them, they act as bottlenecks that hide 24 cards at the start.\n\nManage your foundations evenly. If you build one suit too far up, you might find that the corresponding descending foundation for that suit is blocked by cards you've already 'packed away'.\n\nUtilization of the 'Meeting Point': Strategic transfers between the ascending and descending foundations can be used to free up a specific card needed for the tableau.",
